version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-05-11"
abstract: >-
  ShieldLab G4 is a Geant4-based radiation-shielding simulation platform
  combining Monte Carlo transport with an analytical photon-shielding
  layer (NIST/XCOM, ANSI/ANS-6.4.3 G-P buildup), a Streamlit UI, a
  FastAPI service, and Azure-hosted batch workers.
keywords:
  - radiation shielding
  - Geant4
  - Monte Carlo
  - photon attenuation
  - dosimetry
